Subject: [PATCH 01/29] v4.5: complete implementation

- Weight from static_prio, slope 98/100 (2% floor)
- Futex bypass: set in waitwake.c, halve vslice in place_entity
- Remove two-pole/prev_ema, carriage_ns, dead pick_eevdf check

All commits squashed into one cumulative patch.

Signed-off-by: Galih Tama <galpt@v.recipes>
